title: What I am unsure of.
pid: 386de4e1-c8ba-4a7e-809b-59afecd8e83c
body: |2-
  I could not see an interactive Claude Code from the inside; the one
  running in this container, started by hand, is also a process named
  'claude', so the walk should find it, but no hold has yet been made
  from one. The pacer that started this session predates the change,
  so this session had no 'PACER_SESSION'; that path I tested only with
  a fake 'claude'. Making the pacer wait while 'graph' is held was my
  choice, not asked for; if you want paced sessions to start anyway and
  work on what is free, delete that one block in 'run'.
